## Streaming

The Gemini API supports [streaming responses](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/text-generation?lang=python#generate-a-text-stream).  

### Python

    from openai import OpenAI

    client = OpenAI(
        api_key="GEMINI_API_KEY",
